o 与多家银行洽谈为 SpaceX 400 亿美元 Nvidia GPU 采购融资","summary":null,"sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/07/spacex-nvidia-chips-apollo-financing.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-07T16:32:30.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"kzb8syl0bd20jpjou9bs77n6g"}],"citationId":"m35nq0cis7jklr9fxr7rqj5dl"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"DeepSeek 拟将本轮融资规模翻倍至最高 150 亿美元","summary":"据知情人士向 CNBC 透露，中国 AI 公司 DeepSeek 正考虑将最新一轮融资规模扩大至最高 1000 亿元人民币（约 149 亿美元），较此前 500 亿元的目标翻倍。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/06/deepseek-funding-round.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-06T12:59:10.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"DeepSeek融资规模超预期至至少800亿元人民币，腾讯与宁德时代领投","summary":null,"sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783055","publishedAt":"2026-10-06T06:26:17.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"jc72jjnag9iry0bbwpcwc1ox3"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/eda78dda8cb7add69281b2fb60155ca15821ed87b36f53bee54a353f436709ba.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/47b27ccea2f9260b781ea31db02a26e2e28382a33fdb3006fd6110d8289ddc65.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/eda78dda8cb7add69281b2fb60155ca15821ed8