l":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783114","publishedAt":"2026-10-07T11:01:32.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"ps4qu34vp925tgvdmvvx1a0z5"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"法国学生抗议蔓延全国，勒庞承诺财政转向","summary":"法国多地学生抗议持续升级，教育部长称已有190名学生受伤，司法部称抗议开始以来共5060人被捕，其中87%为未成年人。法国政府正就2027年预算展开谈判，财政部长表示预算目标为540亿欧元（约607亿美元）的财政调整，部分来自冻结教师等公共部门工资。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/06/france-student-protests-budget.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-06T09:46:34.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"zgp26a9b0t31cde6vhg7aymfw"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"30年期美债收益率逼近6%，CTD切换或引发国债期货连锁调仓","summary":"30年期美债收益率周一升至5.70%，为2002年以来最高，逼近6%可能触发长期国债期货最便宜可交割券（CTD）从2045年到期国债切换至2050年到期国债。法国巴黎银行、巴克莱和高盛策略师指出，资产管理机构为应对CTD切换将卖出国债期货，可能加剧长端收益率上行；巴克莱估算其再平衡需求在长期国债期货上约为每基点2500万美元，超长期合约约为每基点300万美元。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783043","publishedAt":"2026-10-06T01:45:29.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"c1wybj5d2tf20dn951n59ih79"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"OKX以250亿美元估值完成新一轮融资，渣打银行和Circle等参投","summary":"加密交易所OKX以250亿美元估值完成新一轮融资，投资方包括现有合作伙伴、对冲基金Qube Research & Technologies，以及Circle、Ripple和渣打银行投资部门SC Ventures。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a11117-e176-7309-925a-b6836b4a6e08","publishedAt":"2026-10-06T12:02:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":6,"citationId":"rlqismz02wy01vjtju0xjmnrc"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Meta、微软削减内部Claude用量，Anthropic营收前景承压","summary":"据The Information报道，Meta和微软正大幅压缩对Anthropic旗下Claude的内部使用，转而推动员工采用自研工具。微软内部Claude年支出预算原预计至少10亿美元，已被削减逾三分之一；Meta内部使用Claude Code的员工数从今年早些时候约6万人降至约3万人，降幅接近50%。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783031","publishedAt":"2026-10-05T20:09:19.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"vc1knynr6d68yurf95xeftbnz"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"纽约联储调查：美国消费者一年期通胀预期升至3.9%，创三年多新高","summary":"纽约联储《消费者预期调查》显示，美国消费者对未来一年通胀率的中值预期从8月的3.6%升至9月的3.9%，创2023年5月以来最高水平；未来三年通胀预期中值从3.2%小幅升至3.3%，五年期维持在3%不变。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783123","publishedAt":"2026-10-07T15:42:21.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"uz3b3ai53261xfoaxvkm38y9x"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Justin Drake 警告 ECDSA 最坏或数月内被破解，建议大户迁移资产至新地址","summary":"密码学研究员 Justin Drake 在 X 平台发帖，呼吁区块链行业冷静规划“地堡模式”，建议大额持有者把大部分资金迁移到从未签名过交易、公钥仍隐藏在哈希之后的新地址，此后每次签名都将剩余资金转到新地址。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1172c-aeac-701c-8a78-d649d82bd652","publishedAt":"2026-10-07T16:21:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":5,"citationId":"dlhx29z7n1z8i0jobevcc2qh7"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美 EIA 大幅上调油价预期，布油 Q4 调升 15%，料 AI 数据中心推动美国今明年电力需求创纪录","summary":"美国能源信息署（EIA）10 月 6 日发布短期能源报告，将布伦特原油 2026 年均价上调至约 98 美元/桶，较此前预测高 8%，四季度均价预期约 105 美元/桶，高出此前估计 15%。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783079","publishedAt":"2026-10-06T21:20:44.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"bcbonbyrm3i7bb6k0tuj0q7kd"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"霍尔木兹海峡油轮遇袭增加，原油出口反弹承压","summary":"伊朗加大了对通过霍尔木兹海峡油轮的袭击，过去一个月近20艘商船在霍尔木兹海峡、波斯湾或阿曼近海遇袭，威胁波斯湾原油出口的脆弱反弹。Kpler数据显示，截至上周六当周原油运输量约1030万桶/日，较战前基线1350万桶/日低约23%；Windward估计经霍尔木兹的原油均值为900万至1000万桶/日，战前基线为1450万桶/日。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/06/crude-oil-tanker-strait-hormuz-iran-attack.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-06T16:19:10.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"h03acdo2yb6m9tvk0bc9e3o1o"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":8,"firstPartyEvents":11},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":null,"next":"2026-10-09"}